    "text": "{\"projectId\":\"8978791379095391159\",\"sessionId\":\"11250778364493967969\",\"outputComponents\":[{\"designSystem\":{\"name\":\"assets/e5da08557a334378aff6cb8617ccb28e\",\"designSystem\":{\"displayName\":\"Genius Trader Liquid Glass\",\"styleGuidelines\":\"## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system introduces an ultra-refined, light-mode liquid glass aesthetic tailored for a high-performance quantitative and discretionary trading terminal. It balances institutional analytical precision with Apple-native lightness, clarity, and tactile intimacy.\\n\\n### Aesthetic Principles\\n- **Ethereal Transparency:** Replaces dense, opaque trading panels with multi-layered, ultra-clear frosted glass membranes. Interfaces float above market data flows rather than boxing them in.\\n- **Refined Data Restraint:** Rather than overwhelming the user with uncalibrated neon indicators, the interface employs deliberate, low-fatigue chromatic signals: jade emerald for profits, crimson rose for losses, and muted mineral greys for foundational price action.\\n- **Haptic & Fluid Ergonomics:** Floating frosted glass controls mimic polished physical lenses with soft specular highlights, ultra-fine inner rims, and spring-physics tactile states.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nDesigned for the standard iPhone viewport (402pt × 874pt), balancing ergonomic one-handed operation with high-density data display.\\n\\n### Layout Mechanics\\n- **Grid Structure:** Fluid 4-column layout on mobile with an outer margin of `16pt` (`1rem`) and column gutters of `12pt` (`0.75rem`).\\n- **Safe Area Integration:**\\n  - Dynamic Island / Sensor Notch: Top inset minimum `59pt`.\\n  - Home Indicator: Bottom clearance minimum `34pt`. Floating action pods hover `16pt` above this safe zone.\\n- **Viewport Division (Trading Interface):**\\n  - Top Floating Bar: Compact header (account net worth, ticker selector, network ping).\\n  - Central Stage: Full-bleed candlestick engine with minimal overlay glass badges.\\n  - Lower Drawer / Control Deck: Detached, floating frosted glass sheets containing order execution, depth ladders, and positioning books.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy uses physical glass properties, translucent depth stages, and ambient diffuse lighting rather than harsh shadow drops or borders.\\n\\n### Elevation Architecture\\n- **Layer 0 (Canvas):** Pure `#FFFFFF` background.\\n- **Layer 1 (Chart Canvas / Flat Canvas):** Unclipped, high-framerate rendering surface.\\n- **Layer 2 (Floating Glass Decks):** \\n  - Fill: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)`.\\n  - Blur: `backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%)`.\\n  - Rim: `box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9), inset 0 -0.5px 0.5px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`.\\n  - Shadow: `0 8px 32px -4px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.04), 0 2px 8px -2px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.02)`.\\n- **Layer 3 (Modals, Contextual Popovers & Floating Actions):**\\n  - Fill: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85)`.\\n  - Blur: `backdrop-filter: blur(32px) saturate(200%)`.\\n  - Rim: `box-shadow: inset 0 1.5px 1.5px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1.0)`.\\n  - Shadow: `0 16px 48px -8px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08), 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.03)`.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### 1. Buttons & Execution Triggers\\n- **Primary Order Action (Long):** Filled with `#169873` (Deep Jade Emerald), text in white, subtle interior specular line at the top edge (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35)`). Active press induces a physical `scale(0.97)` spring transition.\\n- **Primary Order Action (Short):** Filled with `#D7355D` (Crimson Rose), white text, identical specular structure.\\n- **Secondary / Utility Controls:** Translucent glass pills (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75)`), text in `#111827`, soft glow on hover/active.\\n\\n### 2. Charting Elements & Technical Indicators\\n- **Standard Candlesticks:** Bodies and wicks use `#8B9099`. Outlines are suppressed; hollow fills denote upward session ticks, filled bodies
